  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Mix mayonnaise, sugar, cider vinegar, salt, pepper, celery seed, garlic powder, and onion powder together in a large bowl. Add coleslaw mix and toss to coat. Cover and chill for at least 1 hour before serving.",
